<title>USA: MedCare names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>MedCare names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedCare Technologies Inc said Tuesday it named Jeff Aronin as director, president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The position of chief operating officer is newly created. Aronin is replacing Harmel Rayat as president, but Rayat will serve as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Aronin previously served as a director of sales and marketing at American Health Products Corp.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
